<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US><=
span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>What is DevOps? 07/12/2023</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>D=
evOps
that combines development and operations to improve the systems development
life cycle.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US><=
span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>why do we need DevOps?</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>T=
o fulfil
the need of delivering more and faster and better application to meet more =
and
more demands of users. DevOps helps deployment to happen really fast compar=
ed</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>t=
o any
other traditional tools.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>M=
ention
the key aspects or principle behind DevOps?</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>�=
��
Infrastructure as a Code • Continuous Integration • Continuous Deployme=
nt •
Automation • Continuous Monitoring • Security</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>S=
DLC:
Software Development Life Cycle.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>I=
TIL:
Information Technology Information Library.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US><=
span
style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'> </span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>D=
ifference
between Waterfall/Agile/DevOps?</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>W=
aterfall:
This methodology took more time to deliver the product like year.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>A=
gile:
This methodology will develop step by step like monthly once</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>D=
evOps:
DevOps Methodology continuously deploy code through the use of modern tools=
 and
automated processes.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11.0pt'><span lang=3De=
n-US>IaaS
(Infrastructure as a Service) gives you virtual hardware like servers and
storage- </span><span lang=3Den-IN>EC2, EBS, EFS, S3, VPC, ELB, Route 53, A=
uto
