 style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>sudo wget -O /etc/yum.repos.d/jen=
kins.repo
 <a href=3D"https://pkg.jenkins.io/redhat-stable/jenkins.repo">https://pkg.=
jenkins.io/redhat-stable/jenkins.repo</a></p>
